    "insert": "\nThe motivation has the goal to catch reader's interest, explain specific problem and in which domain it occurs and also how the problem is currently handled. It should also state research questions explicitly and precisely.\nYour hook is very good. \nAfter this, you focus a lot about what your proposed system should do. However, it would be important to elaborate further on the problem you want to tackle. \nThe RQs are good in general, only the first seems like the main RQ. \n\n"
