  {
    "insert": "\nIn the approach, the goal is to explain current State of the Art and explain the research gap that would further improve the existing work. It should also state your methods, how they relate to your RQs and what their challenges and limitations are. \nYou do not really write about the SOTA. The SOTA should explain existing technology. If no technology exists which match to your work, you would explain systems that at least use Gen AI in healthcare. \nAlso, in the theoretical framework, you should write about other work, e.g. theoretical foundation of Gen AI, especially in medicine. \nIn your methods you should include potential challenges and limitations. \nAlso, I would consider if you might need more groups to have a comparison for the Gen AI scenario. Otherwise you only have data on the use of Gen AI but you don't know how it performes compared to other systems and approaches. \nIt would also be useful to get a more detailed explanation about what the Digital Twin actually is (e.g. which type of data)\n\n"
